- **Capacitor 8** Android shell; `CapacitorHttp` bypasses CORS natively; Haptics, LocalNotifications, Filesystem, StatusBar, SplashScreen, NativeBiometric
- **View Transitions API** — `document.startViewTransition()` **defers** the DOM mutation (source of a test flake)
- **GSAP 3.15** (free incl. Flip/SplitText/CustomEase), **NumberFlow** (`value` is getter-only; use `update()`), **TradingView Lightweight Charts v5** (`createSeriesMarkers`, not `series.setMarkers`), **AutoAnimate**, **Driver.js** (MIT; intro.js/shepherd.js are AGPL-3.0)
